        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finlayson%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city incorporated as a village in 1905, boasting a Northern Pacific station, sawmill, pickle factory, and potato warehouses.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finlayson%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The original Northern Pacific depot still stands today and is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
