      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finlayson%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Finlayson’s core values focus on guided growth and preserving its historical, cultural, and natural heritage.",
